## Current roadmap / platform inheritance

GitHub #78 and `docs/MESSENGER_PLATFORM_ARCHITECTURE.md` are current product/platform authority. Existing domain-specific safety rules in this file remain valid.

Brand assets may be reused across Web/Desktop/Mobile, but current Web placement is not final. Owner manual design after #122 is allowed to change layout without changing product authority.



# Brand consistency

Generated reference images contain small variations of the Vimla mark. Do not recreate those variations. Use one canonical repository logo/brand asset everywhere.

Vimla brand blue-violet is an identity accent, not the default color for all UI surfaces.
